Now, these are very sketchy - ideas, material, topics, pointers to FTP
and other information sources are welcome.  You can post them or mail
to me.  I think I can easily find lots of the U.S. War on Drugs stuff,
so unless it's good summaries etc. I don't think there's much need to
discuss that.

//Jyrki

